{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33951","headline":"奉詶鲁望见荅鱼牋之什 · 皮日休","name":"奉詶鲁望见荅鱼牋之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻如隐起腻如饴，除却鲛工解制稀。\n欲写恐成河伯诏，试裁疑是水仙衣。\n毫端白獭脂犹湿，指下冰蚕子欲飞。\n若用莫将闲处去，好题春思赠江妃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}